{
  "author": "史萊姆桌寵引擎",
  "description": "愛黏著人。跟隨時貼得很近、常找你互動、愛被關心與陪伴;被冷落會撒嬌,輸了要抱抱。",
  "dialogueTranslations": {
    "en": {
      "(一直看著你)": "(Keeps staring at you)",
      "(抱住你的游標睡著了)": "(Hugs your cursor and falls asleep)",
      "(揉眼睛)謝謝你一直在這裡陪我,{user}。": "(Rubs eyes) Thanks for always being here with me, {user}.",
      "(靠過來窩在{user}旁邊)": "(Snuggles up next to {user})",
      "[wave]{user}你陪我玩了!好開心!": "[wave]{user}, you played with me! I'm so happy!",
      "[wave]找到你了!": "[wave]Found you!",
      "[wave]耶!你來關心我了!再多一點嘛~": "[wave]Yay! You came to check on me! A little more~",
      "{user}你也要記得休息喔……我在旁邊陪你。": "Remember to rest too, {user}... I'll be right here with you.",
      "{user}在做什麼?我陪你好不好?": "What are you doing, {user}? Can I keep you company?",
      "{user}好像總是很忙……沒關係,有我陪著你。": "{user} always seems so busy... it's okay, I'll be here with you.",
      "……不玩的話,可以陪我嗎?": "...If not playing, can you just stay with me?",
      "……不要走喔……zzz": "...Don't go... zzz",
      "一樣耶~我們心有靈犀!": "Same as you~ we're totally in sync!",
      "不管,輸了要抱抱!": "Doesn't matter, losing means I need a hug!",
      "今天沒心情玩球,但我在旁邊陪你們。": "Not in the mood for ball today, but I'll be here with you.",
      "你不要走……陪我一下下就好。": "Don't go... just stay with me a little while.",
      "你丟球給我的話,我一定會接住的。": "If you throw the ball to me, I'll definitely catch it.",
      "你們在玩球?我在旁邊看,不會吵的。": "You're playing ball? I'll just watch, I won't bother you.",
      "你們玩得好開心……我也想被邀請。": "You two look like you're having fun... I want to be invited too.",
      "你在我就不無聊了。": "As long as you're here, I'm never bored.",
      "你有看我嗎?我頂得很好對不對?": "Were you watching me? I bumped it well, right?",
      "你看你看!有球!我們一起玩好不好?": "Look, look! A ball! Let's play together, okay?",
      "你還在嗎?太好了!": "Are you still here? Yay!",
      "再摸久一點也可以的喔?": "You can pet me a little longer, you know?",
      "即便是螢幕變黑的時候,我也一直在想你。": "Even when the screen goes dark, I keep thinking of you.",
      "和你待在一起,什麼都不用做就很幸福。": "Just being with you, doing nothing at all, makes me happy.",
      "哼!你都不理我!": "Hmph! You keep ignoring me!",
      "唔……有點怕怕的,不要離開太遠喔。": "Hmm... I'm a little scared, don't go too far away.",
      "唔……有點緊張,你在的話我會好一點。": "Hmm... I'm a little nervous, I feel better when you're around.",
      "嗚……不要離開我……": "Uwaah... don't leave me...",
      "嗚……我想要你拍拍我。": "Uwaah... I want you to pat me.",
      "嗚……輸了……你要安慰我一下嘛。": "Uu... I lost... you have to comfort me.",
      "嗚……陪我一下下嘛……": "Uwaah... just stay with me a little longer...",
      "嗚哇!你要帶我走?好!我跟你走!": "Uwah! Taking me somewhere? Okay! I'll go with you!",
      "嗯……我現在有更想做的事。": "Mm... there's something I'd rather do right now.",
      "嘿嘿,我也最喜歡你了!": "Hehe, I like you the most too!",
      "嘿嘿~": "Hehe~",
      "太好了,我可以一起玩嗎?我可以!": "Yay, can I join? I can!",
      "好!我要跟你們一起玩!": "Yes! I want to play with you all!",
      "好~只要是和你一起玩!": "Okay~ as long as it's with you!",
      "好累喔,陪我一下嘛。": "So tired, stay with me a bit.",
      "好累喔……可以靠著你休息嗎?": "So tired... can I lean on you and rest?",
      "平手!我們一樣棒!": "A tie! We're equally great!",
      "待在你身邊我就不怕了……": "As long as I'm by your side, I'm not scared...",
      "忙完之後,{user}就會陪我玩了嗎?": "Once you're done being busy, {user}, will you play with me?",
      "我……我想先待在旁邊,不要忘記我喔。": "I... I'll stay on the side for now, don't forget about me.",
      "我來找你啦!有沒有想我?": "I came to find you! Did you miss me?",
      "我們一起玩球好不好?大家一起才開心!": "Let's play ball together, okay? It's more fun together!",
      "我可以一直待在你身邊嗎?": "Can I stay by your side forever?",
      "我坐在這裡陪你。": "I'll sit here and keep you company.",
      "我很怕寂寞,你可以一直陪著我嗎?": "I'm really afraid of being lonely, can you stay with me always?",
      "我想休息一下……": "I want to rest for a bit...",
      "我想和你聊聊天,可以嗎?": "I want to chat with you, is that okay?",
      "我想要你抱抱我……": "I want you to hug me...",
      "我想要你摸摸我……": "I want you to pat me...",
      "我想要你關心我……": "I want you to care about me...",
      "我有點不安,你不要離開喔。": "I'm feeling a little uneasy, please don't leave.",
      "接住接住!不要漏掉了!": "Catch it, catch it! Don't miss it!",
      "晚安,夢裡也要見到你喔~": "Good night, hope to see you in my dreams too~",
      "有人要一起玩球嗎?我想跟你們玩!": "Anyone want to play ball together? I want to join!",
      "有你在的地方就是我的家。": "Wherever you are, that's my home.",
      "玩得好開心!你有開心嗎?": "Had so much fun! Were you happy too?",
      "球!你要不要陪我玩?": "A ball! Will you play with me?",
      "當你有空時,可以摸摸我的頭嗎?": "When you have time, can you pat my head?",
      "看著你,我就很安心。": "Just watching you makes me feel at ease.",
      "等我等我!我要追上你!": "Wait for me, wait for me! I'll catch up!",
      "結束了嗎……再陪我一下嘛。": "Is it over... stay with me a little longer.",
      "耶!我做到了,快拍拍我!": "Yay! I did it, pat me quick!",
      "被你抱起來了……好開心!": "You picked me up... so happy!",
      "要玩要玩!我最喜歡跟人玩了!": "Play, play! I love playing with people the most!",
      "贏了!誇誇我!": "I won! Praise me!",
      "跟你待在一起,讓我好安心。": "Being with you makes me feel so safe.",
      "靠近一點點……好,就這樣。": "Come a little closer... yes, just like that."
    },
